// ============================================================
// drone_vision_xiao_single_file.ino
// ----------------------------------
// ALL-IN-ONE firmware for the XIAO ESP32S3 Sense.
// Contains: model API + architecture constants + FP32 weights
//           + forward pass + camera capture + UART to LiteWing.
//
// PROTOCOL: IDLE by default. Starts inference only when LiteWing
//           sends START command (when autonomous mode is enabled).
//
// Just open this file in Arduino IDE and click Upload.
// ============================================================
// REQUIREMENTS:
//   - Arduino IDE with ESP32 board package (v3.0+)
//   - Board: "XIAO ESP32S3"
//   - USB CDC On Boot: Enabled
//   - PSRAM: Enabled (OPI PSRAM 8MB)
//   - Flash Size: 8MB
//
// PERFORMANCE:
//   - 81.18% collision accuracy (bit-exact with PyTorch)
//   - 0.3747 steering RMSE (matches paper)
//   - ~10-15 FPS on XIAO ESP32S3 (with SIMD)
//
// ============================================================
// WIRING (XIAO <-> LiteWing):
//
//   XIAO BAT+ (back pad)  -> LiteWing +BATT (main battery pad)
//   XIAO BAT- (back pad)  -> LiteWing GND  (main battery pad)
//   XIAO D6 / GPIO43 (TX) -> LiteWing IO1  (UART1 RX)
//   XIAO D7 / GPIO44 (RX) -> LiteWing IO48 (UART1 TX)
//
// POWER:
//   XIAO is powered directly from the LiteWing's 3.7V LiPo battery
//   via BAT+ pad. No boost converter needed (XIAO has built-in PMIC).
//
// ============================================================
// PROTOCOL:
//   1. On boot: camera ON, inference OFF (idle)
//   2. LiteWing sends 'S' (0x53) → XIAO starts inference + sends packets
//   3. LiteWing sends 'X' (0x58) → XIAO stops inference (idle)
//   4. Default: IDLE (no UART traffic, saves power)
//
// ============================================================

